@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 240
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EEF4FB
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #355777
skinparam ActorBorderColor #355777
skinparam ArrowColor #355777
hide footbox
autonumber
title Authentication mutation guard and rate limit

' Sources relative to repository root:
' backend/app/api/dependencies.py
' backend/app/services/auth.py
' backend/app/api/errors.py
' backend/app/main.py

actor Client
participant "FastAPI / guard" as API
participant "Auth service" as Auth
database PostgreSQL as DB
Client -> API : POST /api/v1/auth/{register,sign-in,refresh,logout}
note over API : Malformed JSON may be rejected with 422 before guard execution.\nCORS middleware handles preflight requests separately.
alt Origin present and not allowed
  API --> Client : 403 Origin not allowed
else Refresh cookie present without Origin
  API --> Client : 403 Origin required for cookie authentication
else Origin policy accepted
  API -> Auth : enforce_rate_limit(client address or unknown)
  Auth -> Auth : HMAC address + fixed time window using secret_key
  Auth -> DB : Delete expired buckets; insert bucket in savepoint
  note right of DB : Existing bucket conflict rolls back savepoint only.
  Auth -> DB : Atomically increment if count below limit; COMMIT
  DB --> Auth : Increment accepted or limit reached
  alt Limit reached
    Auth --> API : AuthRateLimited
    API --> Client : 429 + Retry-After: auth_rate_window_seconds
  else Accepted
    Auth --> API : Guard passed
    API -> API : Validate body and run endpoint
    note over API : Invalid body returns 422; the attempt was already counted.\nNative transport requires X-Auth-Platform: native AND no Origin.\nA platform header never bypasses the Origin policy.
    ref over Client, DB : Continue with diagrams 03-06
  end
end
@enduml
